## ❓ FAQ

**Do I need to run it as Administrator?**

Yes — admin rights are required for the overlay to attach.

**Can antivirus software flag the executable?**

Security software may flag unfamiliar executables. Review the file and its source before deciding whether to run it.

**Does it work on Windows 11?**

The desktop guide is intended for Windows 10 and Windows 11, 64-bit systems.

**Can I install GTA 6 on a Windows PC?**

Grand Theft Auto VI is currently listed for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. This guide covers supported console installation preparation, not a native Windows game installation.

**How do I check for game updates?**

Use the update or download management section on your PlayStation or Xbox console and follow the platform's on-screen instructions.

